                            when="1928-01-25T11:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">January 25,
                                1928—11 a.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 11:35
                    a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>7. Your telegram number 1, January 7, 8 p.m. Permission accorded.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Bliss</hi></signed></closer>
